  "details": "1. Open VRChat on Steam while using a Quest2 or Pico4 headset\n\n2. With any avatar, open the Expressions menu on your avatar, go to Expressions > Quick Actions > Avatar Height\n\n3. Try to get a height between 1.41 and 1.47 using the thumbstick. You will notice you're unable to get any number between these 2 numbers, from 1.40 and 1.48 it just go straight up.\n\nPS: I've already talked to multiple people with both Quest2 and Pico4, and they all seem to have this issue.",
